# Maestro `takeScreenshot` output (.maestro/flows/activation-*.yaml). Maestro
# writes <name>.png to the CLI's current working directory at invocation time,
# not a fixed subdirectory. CI invokes `maestro test` from artifacts/screenshots/
# so uploads stay tidy; these are never committed, only attached as CI artifacts.
